98 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 77 0 R
/T (Our argument aims to make clear how imperative Jeffery Epstein's social network was in his ability to break the law, forge the truth, and avoid legal repercussions until his arrest in 2019. Epstein surrounded himself with patrons of every profession to create a network in which he had power and influence over those in law enforcement, legal teams, financial power, and many other realms. )
/E (Our argument aims to make clear how imperative Jeffery Epstein's social network was in his ability to break the law, forge the truth, and avoid legal repercussions until his arrest in 2019. Epstein surrounded himself with patrons of every profession to create a network in which he had power and influence over those in law enforcement, legal teams, financial power, and many other realms. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
99 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 77 0 R
/T (Epstein was a master at not only recruiting people to his network but, more interestingly, keeping them in. Again, we do not aim to accuse patrons of wrongdoing simply by association, rather to study how their support and relations with Epstein allowed him to create a wall of protection no matter the wrongdoing.)
/E (Epstein was a master at not only recruiting people to his network but, more interestingly, keeping them in. Again, we do not aim to accuse patrons of wrongdoing simply by association, rather to study how their support and relations with Epstein allowed him to create a wall of protection no matter the wrongdoing.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [9]
>>
