/P 77 0 R
/T (The dataset that we have decided to analyze is the magnitude and interpersonal connections between members who were in correspondence with Jeffrey Epstein through the documented email logs from the Epstein Files. While we are primarily pulling our data from a website called Jmail, the creators of the website have linked the Republican Oversight Committee and the Department of Justice websites as the ultimate source of their data.)
/E (The dataset that we have decided to analyze is the magnitude and interpersonal connections between members who were in correspondence with Jeffrey Epstein through the documented email logs from the Epstein Files. While we are primarily pulling our data from a website called Jmail, the creators of the website have linked the Republican Oversight Committee and the Department of Justice websites as the ultimate source of their data.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [11]
