/T (We used JMail to create our own dataset that could then be used in R with ggplot to create our visualization. This dataset included the names of the top fifty people in email correspondence with Epstein, the years they were in contact, their job description \(which was not used for this specific finding\), and how many total emails they had sent to Epstein . )
