/T (These visualizations show Epstein's top 15 email senders. The data was drawn from Jmail which we used to create our own dataset to work with in Gephi. The bar chart and Gephi network visualizations show the same story in different ways. The bar chart shows precisely how many emails each person sent. The Gephi network shows how everything links with Epstein being in the middle. )
/E (These visualizations show Epstein's top 15 email senders. The data was drawn from Jmail which we used to create our own dataset to work with in Gephi. The bar chart and Gephi network visualizations show the same story in different ways. The bar chart shows precisely how many emails each person sent. The Gephi network shows how everything links with Epstein being in the middle. )
