149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 79 0 R
/T (A closer look at the data in the bar graph shows that his assistant doubled the amount of Rich Khan, his accountant, and second on the list. It makes you think that the communication might have been happening through one main person rather than between different people. We used Gephi to better illustrate and explain our visualization. Each bar on the graph represents a person with the occupation, and the horizontal axis measures the amount of email sent. There was a substantial number of people in Epstein's network, but what we noticed is how the majority of the communication is with his smaller behind-the-scenes group of people. His accountant comes in second, matching the nodes seen in the Gephi visualization. Most of the nodes in the network are not politicians or celebrities like we would imagine, but the everyday staff that was managing his operations. )
/E (A closer look at the data in the bar graph shows that his assistant doubled the amount of Rich Khan, his accountant, and second on the list. It makes you think that the communication might have been happening through one main person rather than between different people. We used Gephi to better illustrate and explain our visualization. Each bar on the graph represents a person with the occupation, and the horizontal axis measures the amount of email sent. There was a substantial number of people in Epstein's network, but what we noticed is how the majority of the communication is with his smaller behind-the-scenes group of people. His accountant comes in second, matching the nodes seen in the Gephi visualization. Most of the nodes in the network are not politicians or celebrities like we would imagine, but the everyday staff that was managing his operations. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [10]
>>
