412 0 obj
<<
/Title (One of the limitations we experienced was our inability to see the content of the emails themselves, leaving us no way to know the meaning or sentiment behind them. Sure, we could see who was sending the email, their profession, and infer their relationship with Epstein, but our interpretation was limited due to a lack of content.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 365 0 R
/Next 446 0 R
>>
endobj
413 0 obj
<<
/Title (Law enforcement has restrictions on much of the data surrounding the Epstein Files, and because of this our data was limited, as well as our sources. The individuals mentioned in our data sets are based on public knowledge, meaning that is does not imply criminal wrongdoing, guilt, or personal involvement in illegal activity.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 365 0 R
/Prev 447 0 R
>>
endobj
