>>
endobj
416 0 obj
<<
/Title (Although our Figures use different parts of the data, all of them point to the same idea: Jefferey Epstein had strong interpersonal connections with people of all different professions that helped him become the powerful man he was known to be. Figure 1 and 2 go into details about who he was in contact with. These people not only helped his court case with what information came out, but the figures point to the idea that some information was suppressed by these contacts to protect Epstein. These people in high positions of power  not only were in contact with Epstein all the time, sending hundreds of thousands of messages, but also in contact for about a dozen years \(Figure 3\). This long lasting, high frequency contact is what allowed Epstein to stay in power for so long despite legal and financial hits. All of this goes to say that it really is about the people you know, and Jeffery Epstein had the right people on his side which allowed him to hide behind a protective wall for many years.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 367 0 R
>>
endobj
