444 0 obj
<<
/Title (Graphy was used to create a bar chart ranking the top fifteen email senders. We used the same dataset for R. Uploaded it and made a horizontal chart with the individual's name, occupation, and total emails. This visualization was used to make the Gephi network easier to read and straightforward)
